    {
      "tag": "Tens",
      "h2": "Round Tens",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Veinte (20), treinta (30), cuarenta (40), cincuenta (50), sesenta (60), setenta (70), ochenta (80), noventa (90), cien (100)</strong>. Mostly end in -enta.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "21+",
      "h2": "Joined Up",
      "body_html": "<p>21-29 join up: <strong>veintiuno, veintidos, veintitres</strong>. After 30: 'treinta y uno' (31 — 'thirty and one').</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Age",
      "h2": "Saying Age",
      "body_html": "<p>'Tengo 13 anos' = <strong>I have 13 years</strong> = I'm 13. Use <strong>tengo</strong> (I have) — same pattern as French.</p>"
    }
  ],
